 ('9521067b-245f-520c-8f5a-f8cf94dbefff', '2024-2025', 11248, 19576, 7816, 1600, 3392, 24056, 'merit_only', false, true, 'College Navigator 2024-25: tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance for Alabama residents ($32,384 total at the out-of-state tuition rate). The university''s tuition page for 2024-25 prints $11,068 in-state / $19,936 out-of-state tuition and fees; international students pay the out-of-state rate.; International page: international students are ''eligible for academic scholarships and assistantships but not for financial aid'' and pay out-of-state tuition. The scholarship page lists Marion 9 Automatic Scholarships and Competitive Merit Scholarships but prints no amounts or criteria, so none are given here.', 'c92b76d1-c273-5f04-b5c0-9d89eb36bf96');
