 ('dc9b61eb-b8b5-53e3-b7cf-7bc255f62cfd', '2026-27', array['common_app','coalition','questbridge']::text[], true, 2, true, 'not_offered', 75, 'Common App, Apply Coalition with Scoir, or QuestBridge, plus the Amherst College Writing Supplement. Counselor recommendation and two teacher recommendations (English, math, science, social studies or foreign language). Amherst does not offer interviews (InitialView interviews may be shared). Financial aid filing requirements (CSS Profile) were not confirmed on pages checked.', 'aba2df83-6f1c-51c7-9376-aa667df19ef8');
