 ('TOEFL_IBT', 'required_option', 69, 'Listed as ''iTOEFL'' (internet-based). Paper-based TOEFL 550 is also listed. The page does not give the new 1-6 scale.'),
 ('IELTS', 'required_option', 6.0, null),
 ('DUOLINGO', 'required_option', 100, null),
 ('PTE', 'required_option', 60, 'The table lists ''Pearsons'' 60, read here as Pearson PTE Academic.'),
 ('CAMBRIDGE', 'accepted', null, 'Table lists Cambridge B2, CAE C1 and CPE C2 as passing levels; no numeric score is given.')) v;
