 ('0405e464-d86f-5145-9f96-29b29457ae1a'::uuid, 'Engineering and Computer Science BS (Fulton Schools)', 'engineering', false, 'Most Fulton majors (e.g. Aerospace, Mechanical, Electrical, Computer Science BS) need more than the university minimum: SAT 1210 or ACT 24, or 3.00 GPA, or top 25% of class, plus all high school math and science competencies. Engineering (BSE), Computer Science (BA) and some others need only general university requirements.'),
 ('c64c1c21-778b-5a01-904a-2e646baa84ee'::uuid, 'Nursing, BSN (Edson College)', 'nursing', true, 'Direct admission: top 10% of class, or 3.80 competency GPA, or 3.50 GPA with ACT 25/SAT 1230. Priority date Nov. 1; spaces limited; others placed in BS Community Health. Offered at Downtown Phoenix, Polytechnic and West Valley, not Tempe.')) v;

