 ('461ac61b-e5fb-59fc-bb4c-0f9ea5ca2be4', '2025-2026', 45637, 36780, 5155, 4771, 4505, 36127, 28935, 4739, 3340, 2355, 857, 106, 26.7, 1.9, 92.7, '{"4.0": 32, "3.75-3.99": 14, "3.50-3.74": 20, "3.25-3.49": 11, "3.00-3.24": 13, "2.50-2.99": 9, "2.0-2.49": 1}'::jsonb, 'Residency split as printed in CDS C1 (in-state 36,127 / out-of-state 4,739 / international 4,771 applicants). No early decision; early action closes Nov 1 with rolling notification (C21/C22). The CDS reports average GPA on a 100-point scale (91.6), not 4.0, so gpa_avg is omitted. SAT composite percentiles were not published (only ERW and Math); mean SAT 649 ERW / 654 Math, mean ACT 29. All applicants may choose to be considered test-optional (C8).', '0d03e8f0-b738-5b75-9539-d215df6ed503');
