 ('3ed3721b-9031-5fe0-89f6-7beea7e2f31f', '2026-2027', 68574, 3255, 21996, 1428, 3969, 'need_aware_full_need', true, 59, 85696, true, false, 'CDS G1 (first-year, 2026-2027): tuition $68,574, required fees $3,255, food and housing $21,996; G5 residents: books $1,428, other expenses $3,969. H6: need-based institutional aid for nonresidents, 59 awarded, average $85,696, total $5,056,044. SAT composite percentiles are blank in CDS C9 (only section scores reported).; Need-blind for U.S. citizens and permanent residents, need-aware for international applicants; meets 100% of demonstrated need for admitted students. International students must apply for aid at application time to be eligible later. Caltech does not award merit scholarships. Financial aid deadlines for the 2026-27 cycle were not yet posted (the aid pages still show fall 2026 entry).', '1817c517-de31-5c09-b4d4-fb698fb46e4e');
