 ('852a57a1-f08c-52b4-94e1-bae80989c193', '2025-2026', 8055, 7346, 2084, 13, 13, 7031, 6390, 1011, 943, 24.14, 0.67, 3.43, 99.95, '{"4.0": 12.0, "3.75-3.99": 21.2, "3.50-3.74": 24.0, "3.25-3.49": 11.4, "3.00-3.24": 11.9, "2.50-2.99": 13.8, "2.0-2.49": 5.3, "1.0-1.99": 0.3}'::jsonb, 'CDS covers all campuses of the merged university (Bloomsburg, Lock Haven, Mansfield); figures are not split by campus. Fall 2025 first-year class. The C1 residency split reports 13 international applicants, all 13 admitted and all 13 enrolled. Undergrad enrollment is the B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' column (9,488, incl. non-degree-seeking; nonresident 58). C6 says it is not an open-admission school; no early decision or early action. Only about a quarter of enrolled students submitted SAT scores, so the score percentiles describe that subgroup.', '7e67abc6-d0fc-5a20-9b1b-2bda6b8d0558');
