 ('a082e67f-7069-5011-becf-2af5e03501d1', '74c3f3c1-3a51-53c9-aead-ee064957e7aa', '2026-27', 'financial_aid', 'ED', 'International aid application (ED)', '2026-11-01', 'Deadline for international students; missing it forfeits aid eligibility for the whole undergraduate career.', '48885ee5-463b-52e9-83c2-2f7d8bc6fa61'),
