 ('c94c3281-178d-540d-badc-47c8d10093d4', '2024-2025', 9720, 17944, 12100, 1460, 3294, 34798, 'merit_only', false, true, 'College Navigator 2024-25 (tuition and fees, first-year full-time): in-state $9,720, out-of-state $17,944; books $1,460; on-campus food and housing $12,100; other expenses $3,294; total on campus out-of-state $34,798 (in-state $26,574). The 2026-27 cost-of-attendance page could not be read, so 2026-27 figures are not given.; International Merit Scholarship: $8,000 per academic year for new F-1 students with a minimum incoming 3.0 GPA, full-time, first bachelor''s degree, renewable up to four years for freshmen; applies to Fall 2026 and later; cannot be combined with other institutional non-athletic aid (read through a search extract of the scholarships page). No need-based aid for international students was found.', '3610b865-78ea-5ec8-b702-b3a3d23245c1');
