 ('17beae99-fcfb-53dd-b194-b252dde85241', '2024-2025', 7352, 15302, 15302, 22260, 1500, 6216, 45278, false, 'College Navigator 2024-25: tuition includes required fees; off-campus food and housing (Medgar Evers has no campus housing); total is the out-of-state off-campus figure (in-state off-campus $37,328). F-1/J-1 students pay the New York State non-resident rate (CUNY). CUNY''s 2026-27 rates: $620 per credit non-resident, $3,465 per semester NYS resident full-time (12+ credits) plus fees.; International (F-1/J-1) students pay the NYS non-resident rate ($620 per credit in 2026-27, CUNY-wide). No merit scholarship for international first-year students was found on the pages checked, so the policy is left null.', 'cb30562c-1a14-5e75-bf9e-d452b1aa3998');
