 ('b77cf73f-067f-55a3-a9b8-84bbaca99ff0', '2024-2025', 26369, 23527, 4022, 313, 292, 17413, 16367, 8643, 6867, 10, 23, 3.28, 99.83, '{"4.0": 2.71, "3.75-3.99": 14.67, "3.50-3.74": 17.46, "3.25-3.49": 17.96, "3.00-3.24": 18.88, "2.50-2.99": 26.92, "2.0-2.49": 1.39}'::jsonb, 'Fall 2024 first-time first-year cohort, CDS C1 residency table (in-state / out-of-state / international: 17,413 / 8,643 / 313 applied; 16,367 / 6,867 / 292 admitted; 3,308 / 701 / 13 enrolled). The 2024-2025 CDS is the newest ECU publishes (no 2025-2026 edition found). Only 10% (403) of enrollees submitted SAT and 23% (918) ACT. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. Undergraduate enrollment (21,445) is from College Navigator, not the CDS (the CDS B1 table is an image). C7 factor checkboxes are not machine-readable, so factors are omitted.', '679f1dd2-17ce-58a5-bb8f-5598ec239a40');
