 ('1a02e844-e7af-505a-a9c9-ded7b7a9143c', 'dd7d3e1b-ab8f-5e06-bf19-6cfb443a96b0', 'ipeds', 'IPEDS Fall Enrollment 2023 (EF2023A): undergraduate total and U.S. nonresident headcount', 'https://nces.ed.gov/collegenavigator/?id=169798', '2023-2024', '2026-10-26'),
