 ('7b6585f1-e602-543e-9507-8c59dfe7c123', '8101c328-fffa-52c4-80d8-8b37f449a3a3', 'medicine', 'Medicine MBChB (6-year programme)', 'MBChB', 'A100', null, 'AAA, in one sitting', null, null, 'UCAT (Situational Judgement Band 4 means rejection)', '2026-10-15', 7.5, 7.5, null, 'IELTS 7.5 in every component. Other tests were not extracted.', 'Required subjects were not extracted. Duration, tuition fee and offer statistics were not found, so they are left empty.', 'https://study.ed.ac.uk/programmes/undergraduate/354-mbchb-medicine-6-year-programme/entry-requirements', '2026-10-22');

