 ('8b8b98b6-5774-572f-9165-4f70cbccd04a', '2025-2026', 37561, 3869, 1443, 4728, 1049, 9207, 576, 4380, 447, 23974, 2846, 7608, 6422, 274, 47, 21, 3.8, 95, '{"4.0": 14, "3.75-3.99": 63, "3.50-3.74": 21, "3.25-3.49": 2}'::jsonb, 'Fall 2025 entering class (CDS 2025-2026 C1, C2, C9, C11, C12, C21). Early decision counts cover both ED plans (ED I and ED II). Emory is test-optional, so SAT/ACT percentiles describe only the 47% (SAT) and 21% (ACT) of enrollees who submitted scores.', '30633e7a-7444-5aaf-b15f-f0b88dd18b68');
