 ('fba2b72a-0833-5d07-991f-bb06848c19be', '2024-2025', 7070, 17560, 17560, 1556, 16182, 1300, 'none', false, false, false, 'CDS G1 (first-year, 2024-25): nonresident tuition $17,560, required fees $1,556, food and housing on campus $16,182. These are 2024-25 figures; 2026-27 rates were not confirmed.; The How to Apply page states ''Financial aid and scholarships are not available to international students.'' Proof of funds for the I-20: $40,000 if living on campus, $28,000 if living off campus with a local sponsor providing room and meals (Professional Pilot adds about $9,000/semester). SUNY-mandated health insurance applies to F-1/J-1 students. No ESL, conditional-admission or pathway program is described on the international pages.', '0deb0092-1c88-5d67-a5d0-40f4a8558cba');
