 ('d1619d93-1293-53c0-af6d-8567c958802e'::uuid, 'Nursing (BS, 4-year, freshman entry)', 'nursing', true, 'Admission chart: 90 minimum average, Biology Regents 75+, Chemistry Regents 70+, Algebra II, TEAS proficient or higher. Application and document deadline January 15; admission is competitive because seating is limited.')) v;

