 ('5997edcf-bcfb-5ea1-9335-df996b743136', '99030f47-acca-5a5f-a607-18966c80d0cc', 'Nursing, Music, Athletic Training, PGM (specialized admissions programs)', 'nursing', 'pre_major_competitive', false, 'Students are admitted to FGCU as pre-majors and submit a supplemental application later, typically in sophomore year; not decided at freshman admission. Capacity is not stated on the page.');

