 ('cb7a90c7-d930-51aa-a6df-5f58830558c6', '2025-2026', 41299, 24023, 4260, 1216, 722, 25020, 16345, 15063, 6956, 76.38, 22.61, 3.87, 99.84, '{"4.0": 38.89, "3.75-3.99": 22.22, "3.50-3.74": 19.63, "3.25-3.49": 13.9, "3.00-3.24": 4.84, "2.50-2.99": 0.38, "2.0-2.49": 0.12}'::jsonb, 'Fall 2025 first-year class from the CDS C1 residency table (in-state 25,020 / out-of-state 15,063 / international 1,216 applicants; international admit rate 59.4% vs 58.2% overall). Undergrad enrollment and intl count are the B1/B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' figures (25,626; nonresident 724). The CDS C7 factor checkboxes and C8 test boxes are not machine-readable, so factors are omitted; SAT/ACT are required by Florida Board of Governors rule per the admissions site. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. ACT subscore percentiles omitted (rows misaligned in the text layer).', 'a9068e38-1935-5a3b-9c5e-82aeab84a0d8');
