 ('d38493d8-6926-5a58-8acd-9f39efe3e7bb', '2025-2026', 13329, 12205, 1602, 440, 390, 9840, 9107, 3047, 2708, 71, 5, 3.31, 99.8, '{"4.0": 12.2, "3.75-3.99": 15.07, "3.50-3.74": 14.07, "3.25-3.49": 14.01, "3.00-3.24": 12.51, "2.50-2.99": 27.7, "2.0-2.49": 4.44}'::jsonb, 'Fall 2025 first-time first-year class (CDS C1 residency breakdown: 440 international applicants, 390 admitted, 26 enrolled; 2 applicants of unknown residency). Undergrad enrollment 6,352 and intl 104 are the B2 total undergraduates / nonresident figures. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11 (the 1.0-1.99 and below-1.0 rows are blank). CDS C7 factor checkboxes are not legible in the PDF text, so factors are omitted. Student-to-faculty ratio is blank in the CDS.', '32cb29e3-eaa1-5a6e-823b-634e1f23ccc0');
