 ('3a0e4180-56b3-5912-93c3-0d67ad9fa3aa', '2023-2024', 12144, 42295, 14160, 1290, 3328, 30517, 'merit_only', true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; International students are eligible for IU merit scholarships (judged from the admission application, deadline Nov 1 for IU scholarships, Feb 1 for international-student merit awards) and some country-specific awards. They cannot use US federal loans. The pages do not describe need-based institutional aid for international freshmen.', '6cd55e68-0862-5cda-be39-37583dc1bacb');
