 ('9d758500-4eec-590c-84ee-6021c91b5b97', '2025-2026', 16460, 12846, 3218, 625, 350, 11978, 9634, 3857, 2862, 28.5, 2.4, 3.49, 93.47, '{"4.0": 19.38, "3.75-3.99": 16.62, "3.50-3.74": 18.22, "3.25-3.49": 16.52, "3.00-3.24": 14.73, "2.50-2.99": 12.2, "2.0-2.49": 2.13, "1.0-1.99": 0.2}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (Fall 2025 first-time first-year, IU Indianapolis campus): 16,460 applied, 12,846 admitted (78%). International: 625 applied, 350 admitted (56%), 19 enrolled, so international applicants are admitted far less often than domestic ones. No early decision; no waitlist. C9: 28.5% of enrolled students submitted SAT (918), 2.4% ACT (78). IU Indianapolis was created in 2024 when IUPUI was split; every figure here is the IU Indianapolis Fall 2025 CDS, no IUPUI-era figure is used. C7 factor checkboxes could not be read reliably from the text and are omitted. Undergraduate enrollment and intl_undergrads are the B1/B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' figures (14,834; nonresident 273 including non-degree students).', 'bc8f8cf5-e440-52c4-a1cf-81eb57272085');
