 ('665b5c1e-403e-5ec2-9562-eedc693580e7', '2023-2024', 67170, 21002, 1367, 2291, 88834, true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Need-based and merit scholarships are available to international applicants, but both are limited. You must apply for aid as a first-year applicant (no aid later); no aid for international transfer students. The page does not state whether admission is need-aware or whether full need is met for international students.', '456680f4-eaf9-561b-bcde-2ebc46e29990');
