 ('5e1b1341-fe14-595f-b676-31e917e3472d', '2025-2026', 33387, 31222, 6960, 1086, 976, 9087, 8658, 23214, 21588, 9, 48, 3.58, 100.0, '{"4.0": 14.1, "3.75-3.99": 30.6, "3.50-3.74": 21.1, "3.25-3.49": 14.1, "3.00-3.24": 10.6, "2.50-2.99": 8.4, "2.0-2.49": 1.1, "1.0-1.99": 0.0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025 entering class). International: 1,086 applied, 976 admitted. SAT scores were submitted by 9% (600) and ACT by 48% (3,357) of enrollees. Undergrad enrollment and nonresident count are the B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' column (27,386; nonresident 372). Student-to-faculty ratio 18:1 is from College Navigator. Waitlist and early-plan data not read.', '511ceb2e-a2e9-544f-b8fb-ea4732580a5e');
