 ('88f64cc4-5ffb-52cc-8b95-a1d9136316bb'::uuid, 'Engineering (College of Engineering)', 'engineering', 'The first-year page lists no separate application, portfolio or direct-admission cutoff; it recommends Algebra 1 and 2, trigonometry, pre-calculus, two semesters of chemistry and two of physics.'),
