 ('b32a563a-004e-5775-bfaf-f40885be3093', '2025-2026', 19342, 5601, 1535, 2040, 966, 4182, 176, 3090, 1010, 12070, 4415, 4083, 1988, 80, 33.03, 10.29, 'Fall 2025 entering class. Lehigh did not report average high-school GPA or the GPA distribution (C11/C12 blank). ED figure (C21) covers Early Decision. SAT/ACT submission is optional: scores are considered only if the applicant asks to have them added.', '0ccb52f0-33bf-58aa-ad3f-d4dbc4623af3');
