 ('5e083701-179a-5ef5-bbc4-4fa8fd00bd1b', 'ab57ea63-f51e-5e1b-a9f3-13e2ae779039', 'Conservatory of Music and BFA Drama', 'arts_design', 'direct_major', false, 'An audition is required for these programs; other majors have no extra admission step stated.');

