 ('70bcff84-a18b-56f5-8085-196e313ddab4'::uuid, 'Nursing (BSN)', 'nursing', 'Admission to the university is direct into a program, but nursing has additional requirements (BSN catalog: 2.80 cumulative GPA, NSG 129 passed with C+ or higher, prerequisites); the English-proficiency bar for nursing is higher.'),
 ('8d0c0258-9164-5a75-995a-a9cb62c80bab'::uuid, 'Engineering (E.S. Witchger School of Engineering)', 'engineering', 'Admissions page says nursing, education and engineering have additional admission requirements beyond university acceptance; the specific engineering criteria were not found.')) v;

