 ('05de2d4c-d45d-5bd4-b748-d03cc469394c', '2025-2026', 6827, 6597, 1938, 93, 91, 3570, 3451, 3164, 3055, 71, 42, 3.6, 98.9, '{"4.0": 32, "3.75-3.99": 16, "3.50-3.74": 14, "3.25-3.49": 11, "3.00-3.24": 9, "2.50-2.99": 11, "2.0-2.49": 6, "1.0-1.99": 1}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (Fall 2025). International: 93 applied, 91 admitted, 16 enrolled (C1 residency table). GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. No early decision or early action; no waitlist. SAT composite percentiles 940/1040/1140 are also published; the composite is not a stored test type. The CDS file''s page headers say 2024-2025 but the cohort and dates refer to Fall 2025. The C7 factor checkboxes could not be read reliably from the text, so no factors are recorded.', '9aa61030-599e-5e5f-b6a0-5c3cb9a79d89');
