 ('c9742a05-7ff6-523b-a29a-cca274eb9e65', '2023-2024', 3599, 2876, 410, 632, 330, 1504, 1317, 1463, 1229, 6, 2, 3.3, 100.0, '{"4.0": 12, "3.75-3.99": 15, "3.50-3.74": 14, "3.25-3.49": 13, "3.00-3.24": 13, "2.50-2.99": 27, "2.0-2.49": 6}'::jsonb, 'CDS 2023-24 is the newest Marymount posts that could be found (fall 2023 entering class). C1 residency table: international 632 applied, 330 admitted (52%). Enrolled 410 (CDS gender rows; matches IPEDS) while the residency enrollee row sums to 407. SAT/ACT percentiles not reported (the university does not use scores). Undergraduate enrollment 2,503 is fall 2024 (College Navigator).', 'bb9a1843-7dcb-56f1-bb27-8117b60be829');
