 ('0d331af3-1054-5cab-a587-0f4abeed11e0', '2025-2026', 6692, 6366, 835, 667, 618, 2910, 2809, 3089, 2919, 8, 32, 3.56, 99.28, '{"4.0": 26.1, "3.75-3.99": 20.0, "3.50-3.74": 17.6, "3.25-3.49": 10.4, "3.00-3.24": 9.4, "2.50-2.99": 10.5, "2.0-2.49": 3.5, "1.0-1.99": 2.3}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025 entering class): international applicants 667, admitted 618 (92.7%), enrolled 37. Rolling admission, no early decision or early action, no waitlist. Only 67 SAT and 269 ACT submitters (8% and 32% of enrollees), so the test percentiles describe a minority of students. The remaining 0.2% of enrollees had a GPA below 1.0 (not shown). Undergrad count is B1 total undergraduates (5,274); intl_undergrads is the B1 nonresident total (155).', '703f7d44-b017-5c18-a51e-ab49680ce582');
