 ('d47e42b4-c1ae-59a6-8e16-044e4429a3bd', 'required_nonnative', 'Not required if you are a US citizen/permanent resident or English is your first language. Also met by SAT (EBRW 510+ with total 1110+), ACT (English 18+ with composite 23+), AP English Language 4+, IB English A 5+, IGCSE/GCSE/A-level English results, 3 years of US high school with GPA 3.0+, or a year at a US university. A provisional-admission band exists below the regular minimums.', 'f4fa22cd-539c-5bee-81e7-90e0b82c733e');
