 ('35228703-5f8c-5c73-8e57-d772f27d443f', '2025-2026', 11831, 1511, 634, 1179, 460, 1996, 1878, 109, 33, 16, 'From Middlebury''s PRELIMINARY Fall 2025 CDS (file footers still carry the 2024-2025 template label; data are labelled Fall 2025). Admits are September admits only (excludes February admits). No residency split, GPA or class-rank figures reported. ED1 and ED2; no early action.', '3cb593cb-f952-5a3b-8daa-ed1016ea4667');
