 ('50516c25-3274-5cc1-988f-761f1f528a88', '2026-2027', 11128, 22952, 17620, 300, 13890, 1000, 1400, 33660, 'International estimated annual proof-of-funding for 2026-2027: tuition and fees $17,620 (includes some mandatory fees; 12-18 credits per semester), living expenses $13,890, health insurance $750, books and miscellaneous $1,400, total $33,660. A separate $150 per semester international student fee ($300 per year) is charged in addition and is not in that total.; College Navigator estimated expenses 2024-2025 (tuition and fees; on-campus food and housing). Superseded for international students by the cycle-file international cost.; Millersville''s admissions-scholarships page lists an ''International Scholarships'' contact (717-871-7506, international@millersville.edu). Award names and amounts could not be confirmed: the international financial-assistance page was unreachable (404) when checked, so scholarship amounts are left null. Confirm with International Admissions.', 'd7325d55-7297-5941-b3c8-ed8e05224a40');
