 ('e4c071b9-1c42-5ad6-9065-598353629dfc', '2025-2026', 2613, 2523, 586, 731, 694, 1186, 1146, 696, 683, 5, 70, 3.49, 95.39, '{"4.0": 18.26, "3.75-3.99": 22.36, "3.50-3.74": 14.31, "3.25-3.49": 13.77, "3.00-3.24": 11.09, "2.50-2.99": 14.13, "2.0-2.49": 5.72, "1.0-1.99": 0.36}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025 first-time first-year): 2,613 applicants, 2,523 admitted (97%), 586 enrolled. International: 731 applied, 694 admitted (about 95%), 29 enrolled. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. Percentiles: only 27 SAT submitters (5%) vs 412 ACT (70%); ACT Reading 18/22/28 and Science 18/22/24 are not stored. Undergraduate enrollment 3,917 and 141 nonresident undergraduates are the B1/B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' figures. Open admission policy box is N/A; no early decision/action.', '7028b6fd-5585-552a-b1db-1eafe79c76d2');
