 ('e9621290-b819-530e-8686-a29bcd22bd4b', '2025-2026', 19892, 19769, 3743, 182, 181, 4043, 4034, 15667, 15554, 14, 29, 3.51, 99.25, '{"4.0": 21.64, "3.75-3.99": 21.35, "3.50-3.74": 17.87, "3.25-3.49": 12.27, "3.00-3.24": 10.23, "2.50-2.99": 11.68, "2.0-2.49": 3.93, "1.0-1.99": 1.03}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025 entering class): 19,892 applied, 19,769 admitted, 3,743 enrolled; the international row (182 applied, 181 admitted, 17 enrolled) is by residency at application. These admit counts are far higher than IPEDS for fall 2024 (21,652 applicants, 82% admitted), so treat the CDS admit rate with caution. Undergraduate enrollment is B1 ''Total Undergraduate Students'' (15,142); intl_undergrads is the B2 nonresident total for all undergraduates (172; 114 degree-seeking). Student-faculty ratio 18 to 1 (CDS I). The GPA distribution is the published ''all enrolled students'' column. No early decision; early action is rolling. The CDS C7 factor check boxes could not be read, so factors are omitted.', '0fbe08cc-a702-571f-ad75-4749be2cd762');
