 ('17197bf7-8219-5111-b172-b5e0a469e6ae', '2025-2026', 8099, 6814, 1493, 712, 671, 3352, 3190, 3022, 2953, 15, 84, 3.61, 99.33, '{"4.0": 13.26, "3.75-3.99": 31.28, "3.50-3.74": 19.62, "3.25-3.49": 12.99, "3.00-3.24": 10.18, "2.50-2.99": 7.23, "2.0-2.49": 1.27, "1.0-1.99": 0.0}'::jsonb, 'Fall 2025 entering class. International first-year applicants 712, admitted 671, enrolled 14 (C1 residency table). A further 1,013 applicants of unknown residency were not admitted and are not in the in-state/out-of-state/international columns. The all-enrolled GPA column in C11 sums to 95.83% as reported by Murray State. Undergraduate total 8,217 and nonresident-alien undergraduates 760 are from CDS B1/B2.', 'e7af0f07-7cad-55b3-b903-b0b8b8e973db');
