 ('7a9ba862-21ec-5226-b8d2-260c9d5bd2ca', '2024-2025', 7228, 6864, 2197, 115, 100, 2055, 1925, 5058, 4839, 0.6, 51.8, 3.52, 94.9, '{"4.0": 9.4, "3.75-3.99": 29.9, "3.50-3.74": 20.0, "3.25-3.49": 14.0, "3.00-3.24": 12.2, "2.50-2.99": 13.3, "2.0-2.49": 1.1, "1.0-1.99": 0.1}'::jsonb, 'CDS 2024-2025 (fall 2024 entering class). Undergraduate enrollment (9,762) and nonresident count (99) are the B2 ''Total Undergraduates (degree and non-degree)'' column. No waitlist policy. Only 13 enrolled first-years submitted SAT scores (0.6%), so SAT percentiles are not shown; ACT is the test most students submit.', '617969b4-fafd-5a06-8dae-d5316fa77288');
