 ('TOEFL_IBT', 'required_option', 61, 'Full undergraduate admission. TOEFL ITP is not accepted for degree-seeking undergraduates.'),
 ('TOEFL_IBT_2026', 'required_option', 4.0, 'Listed as ''TOEFL Internet-Based (New) 4.0''; the page notes the iBT moves to an adaptive 1-6 scale in January 2026 while scores are still reported on the 0-120 scale during the transition.'),
 ('IELTS', 'required_option', 5.5, 'Academic IELTS only, sent electronically through IELTS E-Delivery; paper Test Report Forms are not accepted.'),
 ('DUOLINGO', 'required_option', 100, 'Minimum for full undergraduate admission.'),
 ('PTE', 'required_option', 51, 'Overall score of 51.'),
 ('CAMBRIDGE', 'accepted', 160, 'Cambridge Certificate in Advanced English (CAE) 160; Cambridge English B2 or higher (CEFR B2+) is also accepted.')) v;
