 ('TOEFL_IBT', 75, 'Scores below 75 can still receive conditional admission.'),
 ('IELTS', 6.0, 'Academic IELTS; below 6.0 can receive conditional admission.'),
 ('DUOLINGO', 105, 'The requirement lists print 105, while the conditional-admission paragraph on the English page says ''below 100''; 105 is used here, confirm with admissions.'),
 ('PTE', 53, 'Below 53 can receive conditional admission.')) v;
