 ('8db12264-f605-5e09-813c-7b1b398aa789', '2025-2026', 6847, 4800, 1094, 184, 100, 5323, 3810, 1340, 890, 3, 74, 3.6, 96, '{"4.0": 18, "3.75-3.99": 30, "3.50-3.74": 19, "3.25-3.49": 11, "3.00-3.24": 10, "2.50-2.99": 9, "2.0-2.49": 3, "1.0-1.99": 0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (Fall 2025 entering class): 6,847 applied, 4,800 admitted (70%); international 184 applied, 100 admitted (54%), 29 enrolled. Only 3% (28 students) of enrolled first-years submitted SAT scores and 74% (814) ACT, so the score ranges describe self-selected submitters. No early decision/action, no waitlist, no application closing date; notification is rolling. The file is labeled ''Common Data Set 2024-2025'' on every page but reports Fall 2025 data. Undergraduate enrollment and nonresident count are the B1/B2 totals (8,437 total undergraduates; 352 nonresidents).', '0b23f6f6-941b-5152-8bc5-fd3b1f0d8143');
