 ('7a6abe7a-cbd8-507c-9228-8c111eec70aa', '2023-2024', 9674, 6073, 1295, 1625, 299, 4519, 3330, 3524, 2441, 5, 79, 3.39, 97.22, '{"4.0": 6.04, "3.75-3.99": 23.99, "3.50-3.74": 18.9, "3.25-3.49": 17.24, "3.00-3.24": 13.82, "2.50-2.99": 14.93, "2.0-2.49": 4.92, "1.0-1.99": 0.16}'::jsonb, 'Fall 2023 entering class (C1, C9, C11, C12). NKU''s 2024-2025 CDS PDF on its site is an unfilled template and no 2025-2026 CDS is posted, so 2023-2024 is the latest usable one. International first-year applicants 1,625, admitted 299, enrolled 12 (C1 residency table); a further 6 applicants of unknown residency (3 admitted) are not in the in-state/out-of-state/international columns. No waitlist.', '8d37ee3c-ba69-5f3f-9d02-3d16001379ee');
