 ('e0b9043b-5f27-5b91-aa48-b41bcb8d9d8e', 'a49d80ae-e1a1-54b6-bceb-1e3bd69434dc', 'College of Health Sciences programs (Nursing, Dental Hygiene, Medical Technology, etc.)', 'nursing', 'pre_major_competitive', false, 'Highly selective and competitive; students are encouraged to apply during their sophomore year to start the program track in junior year. University admission does not guarantee entry; a supplemental application is required once admitted.');

