 ('4c2b747a-e58e-5677-81da-c27164af9675', '2023-2024', 4426, 2961, 649, 34, 16, 'Baseline from IPEDS (fall 2023 entering class; exact counts). No Common Data Set was found on olivet.edu or by search, so no CDS was used; GPA, international and residency splits are not added. College Navigator for fall 2024 shows 5,789 applicants and a 56% admit rate (exact admit count not published there); undergraduate enrollment and the 15:1 student-faculty ratio are fall 2024.', 'f0460fbc-7cad-5394-9bde-5eb9e1bc2875', 'admissions_site');
