 ('71d86629-d4c5-5398-8a51-c67b4d376a17', '2025-2026', 8321, 7800, 651, 789, 731, 2619, 2418, 4913, 4651, 19.97, 1.38, 3.2, 95, '{"4.0": 2, "3.75-3.99": 15, "3.50-3.74": 15, "3.25-3.49": 20, "3.00-3.24": 17, "2.50-2.99": 21, "2.0-2.49": 10, "1.0-1.99": 1}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1/C9/C11/C12, Penn State Abington campus only, fall 2025 entering class (residency split as printed in C1; totals check: in-state + out-of-state + international = total). No early decision; early action closes 11/01 with notification 12/24; no application closing date, rolling. Enrollment: 2,710 undergraduates (CDS B1), 151 nonresident undergraduates (B2). International first-years: 789 applied, 731 admitted (93%), 49 enrolled. SAT/ACT optional (considered if submitted); score percentiles are for the 130 enrolled SAT submitters (ACT: only 9 students). GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11.', '9ea3a651-ba7a-5d0c-a1cc-5c61e9d9e6f0');
