 ('18d95775-c403-5bbe-b563-69f8c8b15a99', '2026-2027', 15388, 26904, 26904, 630, 15092, 1290, 5356, 'none', false, 0, 0, false, false, 'CDS G1/G5 first-year 2026-27, Altoona campus: tuition in-state $15,388, out-of-state/nonresident $26,904 (international students pay the nonresident rate); required fees $630; on-campus food and housing $15,092 (G1; G5 residents'' estimate is $18,276); books $1,290; other_usd = transportation $2,244 + other expenses $3,112. Tuition varies by year of study and program (G3/G4). CDS H6: institutional scholarship and grant aid is not available to nonresident undergraduates.; Penn State states there is essentially no financial aid available for international undergraduate students, and the Altoona CDS (H6) reports no institutional aid for nonresidents.', '66287165-062f-5a7b-bcb9-7c553248336f');
