 ('8bd477be-8758-543e-9d36-446ff4b353af', '2025-2026', 7923, 7601, 802, 755, 685, 1823, 1761, 5345, 5155, 26.06, 2.74, 3.41, 96, '{"4.0": 6, "3.75-3.99": 24, "3.50-3.74": 19, "3.25-3.49": 17, "3.00-3.24": 14, "2.50-2.99": 15, "2.0-2.49": 4, "1.0-1.99": 1}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1/C9/C11/C12, Penn State Behrend campus only, fall 2025 entering class (residency split as printed in C1; totals check: in-state + out-of-state + international = total). No early decision; early action closes 11/01 with notification 12/24; no application closing date, rolling. Enrollment: 3,211 undergraduates (CDS B1), 150 nonresident undergraduates (B2). International first-years: 755 applied, 685 admitted (91%), 48 enrolled. SAT/ACT optional (considered if submitted); score percentiles are for the 209 enrolled SAT submitters (ACT: 22 students). GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11.', '8ce983e1-6ae1-5e5d-bc85-c88b05006d68');
