 ('441ab975-fd7e-5bfa-82f9-ae559dd5d271', '2026-2027', 15388, 26904, 26904, 630, 17336, 1290, 5356, 'none', false, 0, 0, false, false, 'CDS G1/G5 first-year 2026-27, Harrisburg campus: tuition in-state $15,388, out-of-state/nonresident $26,904 (international students pay the nonresident rate); required fees $630; on-campus food and housing $17,336; books $1,290; other_usd = transportation $2,244 + other expenses $3,112. Tuition varies by year of study and program (G3/G4). CDS H6: institutional scholarship and grant aid is not available to nonresident undergraduates.; Penn State states there is essentially no financial aid available for international undergraduate students, and the Harrisburg CDS (H6) reports no institutional aid for nonresidents.', '766abd3b-fd24-52c9-b5d0-54dd06445ff3');
