 ('0a63967c-c5b0-5ad2-a688-ffb3df5f90c9', '2024-2025', 5930, 5594, 1529, 21, 3, 'Baseline from IPEDS (fall 2024 entering class, ADM2024); exact totals (enrolled = full-time 1,467 + part-time 62). College Navigator shows 94% admitted and 27% of admits enrolled. PennWest is one institution (formed 2022 from California, Clarion and Edinboro universities) and no Common Data Set was found on its Institutional Research pages or by search, so GPA, international applicant counts and residency splits are not available. SAT/ACT percentiles are for enrolled first-time students (test-optional, self-selected).', 'd45a5d62-0c31-5a0a-92f1-f7a118d2f495', 'admissions_site');
