 ('98a3d5da-78c7-5d64-86a0-df527ea7de93', '2025-2026', 4386, 4316, 593, 59, 59, 1640, 1614, 2678, 2635, 3.46, 100.0, '{"4.0": 24.0, "3.75-3.99": 15.0, "3.50-3.74": 12.0, "3.25-3.49": 15.0, "3.00-3.24": 12.0, "2.50-2.99": 15.0, "2.0-2.49": 6.0, "1.0-1.99": 0.0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 for the fall 2025 entering class (enrolled 593 = 590 full-time + 3 part-time, matching the residency table total). The residency table has 9 applicants and 8 admits of unknown residency, so in-state + out-of-state + international do not sum to the totals. All 59 international applicants were admitted and 26 enrolled. Point Park is test-blind for domestic first-year applicants (C8A: SAT/ACT not used in admission), so no SAT/ACT percentiles are reported. Enrollment 2,498 and intl 108 are the B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' column (degree-seeking and non-degree; nonresident aliens).', 'cd4ae34d-bfd5-565e-84ee-deecc2b9a78a');
