 ('c7fe9be4-7bbb-5f8e-b7d5-157c028b8b42', '2024-2025', 11299, 26874, 10317, 1571, 4611, 27798, false, true, 'College Navigator 2024-25 estimated expenses for full-time beginning undergraduates: tuition and fees $11,299 in-state, $26,874 out-of-state (international students pay out-of-state); on-campus total $27,798 in-state, $43,373 out-of-state.; Admitted recent high school graduates are automatically considered for University Merit Scholarships (Presidential $11,400 per year: GPA 3.25 and SAT 1190 / ACT 24; Regents'' full tuition and housing: GPA 3.50 and SAT 1260 / ACT 27, with an out-of-state tuition waiver for non-residents). The pages do not say whether international students are eligible, and international need-based aid is not described.', 'fb1048e4-df07-5cf1-9bab-84bf935fb9b2');
