 ('1b4c4ac0-db93-58da-b4e1-aef54f7acd73', '2026-27', array['common_app','questbridge']::text[], true, 2, true, 'optional_informational', 'Princeton-specific Questions plus a graded written paper (preferably English or history) are required. Alumni interviews are optional and can be opted out of in the Princeton-specific Questions. Financial aid uses the free Princeton Financial Aid Application (PFAA). Application fee amount not stated on the pages checked.', '242d510a-03fe-576c-b4e0-c1fd82dcf660');
