 ('98ca9a0f-668c-539c-b3b5-cde3ce0f756c', '2023-2024', 6466, 5539, 1378, 66, 8, 'Baseline from IPEDS (fall 2023 entering class, ADM2023); no readable Common Data Set was found. IPEDS does not split applicants by residency, so international applicants/admits are not available. SAT total, GPA distribution, ED and residency splits are not added. College Navigator also shows fall 2024: 7,631 applicants, 84% admitted, 21% of admits enrolled; about 3% of undergraduates are U.S. nonresidents (fall 2024).', 'e95d5525-d902-541a-b455-f293de48e9cc', 'admissions_site');
