 ('c69d3daa-bbc3-594e-9e76-c875d3a7c2a3', '2025-2026', 28021, 20892, 3431, 202, 150, 553, 411, 4368, 3179, 23100, 17302, 1430, 60, 9, 23, 1.49, 3.65, 99.18, '{"4.0": 28, "3.75-3.99": 15, "3.50-3.74": 21, "3.25-3.49": 13, "3.00-3.24": 15, "2.50-2.99": 7, "2.0-2.49": 1}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025 entering class). International: 553 applied, 411 admitted (74%), 34 enrolled; overall admit rate 75%. ''Enrolled'' is the C1 total of first-time, first-year students (3,431, full- plus part-time). GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. SAT scores are submitted by only 23% of enrollees (test-optional); CDS lists ED (Nov 1) applicants 202 / admitted 150 in C21. Undergrad enrollment is B1 total undergraduates (14,466); intl_undergrads is the B1 total nonresident-alien undergraduates (178).', '9fb0aeb1-3444-5160-9c45-10cf2cf55de8');
