 ('e7989fe9-a980-51ae-b240-fddd56b72611', '2024-2025', 14222, 33734, 3028, 18722, 1418, 58712, 'merit_only', false, 31, 7467, false, 'CDS G1 (AY 2024-25): in-state tuition $14,222, out-of-state $33,734, required fees $3,028 (College Navigator shows the same, $36,762 out-of-state with fees). Room and board, books and total are College Navigator 2024-25 on-campus figures (total is the out-of-state on-campus cost; in-state $39,200); the CDS food-and-housing line reads $16,074. CDS H6: only institutional non-need-based aid is available to nonresidents; 31 nonresidents received it (average $7,467).; CDS H6: no institutional need-based aid for nonresidents; institutional non-need-based aid is available (31 nonresidents received it, average $7,467 in the CDS year). The Newark scholarships page (Chancellor''s Scholarship up to $5,000 a year, Carr Scholarship) lists U.S. citizen, national or permanent-resident eligibility and does not mention F-1 students, so no published international scholarship was confirmed (merit_scholarships left null).', 'aa941ea1-0044-54be-bf2e-ef1827e8fce5');
