 ('095edeb3-f3f8-5647-ba8f-e2be1569a1cc', '2023-2024', 43347, 28326, 7681, 4730, 3345, 28992, 18053, 9625, 6928, 50.9, 5.4, 'CDS C1/C9, fall 2023 entering class (newest CDS Rutgers has posted; no 2024-25 or 2025-26 edition found). GPA (C11/C12) left blank in the CDS; no waitlist data; no early decision; nonbinding early action.', 'b46c121c-8f5f-5b2c-84c4-682002f5b6b2');
