 ('095edeb3-f3f8-5647-ba8f-e2be1569a1cc', '2023-2024', 18824, 39649, 16720, 1446, 4548, 36096, 'merit_only', false, false, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; All admitted first-year international students on non-immigrant visas are automatically considered for Rutgers international merit scholarships ($5,000-$16,000 per year, four years, 3.25 GPA to renew); no separate application. Apply by the EA or RD date to be considered.', '2ba47749-d8a1-59ba-abc7-7e92194f776f');
