 ('TOEFL_IBT_2026', 4.0, 'Page lists ''TOEFL iBT 4.0 overall band score'' (1-6 scale); no minimum for the old 0-120 scale is printed. Institution code 1766; scanned score reports may be uploaded.'),
 ('IELTS', 5.5, 'Overall band 5.5. Institution code 1766; scanned reports may be uploaded.'),
 ('DUOLINGO', 105, 'Send through the Duolingo English Test.'),
 ('PTE', 50, 'Pearson PTE overall score 50.')) v;
