 ('f8633771-8100-5f47-a466-08a6399a6520', '2025-2026', 11089, 10473, 1535, 323, 275, 9064, 8551, 1702, 1647, 39.02, 8.66, 3.291, 99.5, '{"4.0": 5.57, "3.75-3.99": 20.96, "3.50-3.74": 15.72, "3.25-3.49": 14.73, "3.00-3.24": 12.7, "2.50-2.99": 20.1, "2.0-2.49": 10.15, "1.0-1.99": 0.07}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025 entering class): 94% of applicants admitted; international 323 applied, 275 admitted (85%), 10 enrolled. Only 126 of 8,416 undergraduates (B1 totals) are nonresidents, so the international undergraduate community is small. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. No early decision or early action. The CDS was filled in as a PDF form; values were read from the form fields.', 'cff16217-6ea6-50ca-b05d-391a1d335c4f');
