 ('sat', 'The admissions pages say to send scores to South Alabama but do not print a numeric SAT code; look it up in the College Board code search.'),
 ('act', 'The admissions pages do not print a numeric ACT code; look it up at act.org.'),
 ('toefl', 'No TOEFL institution code is listed on the pages checked; look it up in the ETS code search.'),
 ('ielts', 'No institution code is listed.'),
