 ('43709a15-6b1f-50c7-b209-bec4c4ba2c1b', '2026-2027', 16284, 9814, 3697, 29795, false, 'SDSU estimated annual cost for international undergraduates (page does not name the year): tuition and fees $16,284, living expenses $9,814, other $3,697, total $29,795; the page warns of annual increases up to 5%. SDSU''s 2026-27 cost-of-attendance page for domestic nonresidents shows tuition and fees $13,479 and housing/food $11,024.; No international-specific scholarship or waiver is described on the international admissions or estimated-cost pages (they only link to ''Academic Scholarships''); first-time student scholarships are applied for through the MyState portal. Left unset rather than guessed; check with SDSU Admissions.', 'c998ba82-2566-53f0-8126-0a121921c2b2');
