 ('bc39cf98-e440-55b8-8d89-db9c80d8d26a', '2025-2026', 10541, 8063, 1307, 3214, 1637, 4752, 4088, 2554, 2324, 8, 56, 3.53, 99.08, '{"4.0": 21.05, "3.75-3.99": 18.19, "3.50-3.74": 17.5, "3.25-3.49": 16.58, "3.00-3.24": 10.1, "2.50-2.99": 12.03, "2.0-2.49": 3.24, "1.0-1.99": 1.16}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2025 first-time first-year): 10,541 applicants, 8,063 admitted, 1,307 enrolled. International: 3,214 applied, 1,637 admitted (about 51%, much lower than the 76% overall rate), 107 enrolled. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11 (0.15% below 1.0 not shown). No early decision/action and no waitlist. Percentiles: SAT 8% (111 students) and ACT 56% (729) of enrolled first-years submitted scores; ACT Reading 19/23/28 and Science 18/21/24 are not stored. Undergraduate enrollment 7,682 and 442 nonresident undergraduates are the B1/B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' figures.', '4f4dcddc-b67f-5502-911f-414c68b3ef7d');
