 ('d4e6da63-3306-597b-9a38-ce6a8293ad76', '2025-2026', 6790, 6213, 2359, 308, 288, 6291, 5746, 177, 165, 96, 3.46, 96, '{"4.0": 5.4, "3.75-3.99": 22.5, "3.50-3.74": 24.5, "3.25-3.49": 21.7, "3.00-3.24": 12.8, "2.50-2.99": 10.7, "2.0-2.49": 2.2, "1.0-1.99": 0.2}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (Fall 2025): 6,790 applied, 6,213 admitted (91%); international 308 applied, 288 admitted (94%), 26 enrolled. 14 applicants of unknown residency (all admitted) are in the totals only. Enrolled 2,359 is the C1 first-time first-year count (full- and part-time); CDS B1/B2 shows 2,436 degree-seeking first-time first-years, so treat enrollment as approximate. 96% of enrolled first-years submitted ACT scores (1,712); SAT scores are not reported in C9. No waitlist, no early decision/action; CDS C14 gives a Jan. 15 priority date and Aug. 1 closing date. Undergraduate enrollment is the B1 total (14,294 incl. non-degree-seeking; 9,795 degree-seeking); nonresidents 266 (B2).', '16cf22ec-6bf4-5892-b2b4-68d7a039e21b');
