 ('9cec1fe5-c450-59be-b15e-0dbb28fca6cd', '2025-2026', 4843, 4679, 1367, 68, 63, 4039, 3892, 734, 722, 41, 8, 3.42, 99.34, '{"4.0": 6.53, "3.75-3.99": 22.69, "3.50-3.74": 22.45, "3.25-3.49": 16.0, "3.00-3.24": 12.66, "2.50-2.99": 16.4, "2.0-2.49": 3.27}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 residency breakdown (fall 2025): international 68 applied / 63 admitted / 2 enrolled; 2 more with unknown residency. Only 2 international first-time students enrolled, so USI''s first-year international cohort is tiny. The CDS file''s pages are headed ''Common Data Set 2024-2025'' but report fall 2025 data. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled'' column of C11; the average GPA of 3.42 uses unweighted GPAs only. No early decision or early action; no waitlist; rolling notification.', 'b2a3f55d-cef4-51c4-b992-5a5afedbd8e2');
