 ('4dec24ce-91d1-5dac-9b58-9931ce1feffd', '9cec1fe5-c450-59be-b15e-0dbb28fca6cd', 'Nursing, Bachelor of Science in Nursing (BSN)', 'nursing', 'pre_major_competitive', 'USI offers a BSN with direct-admission and standard (first-year GPA based) routes; thresholds were not retrieved from the BSN requirements page, so confirm with the nursing department.');

