 ('TOEFL_IBT', 60, null),
 ('TOEFL_IBT_2026', 3, 'The international page prints ''TOEFL iBT 60 (0-120 scale) or 3 (1-6 scale)''.'),
 ('IELTS', 6.0, null),
 ('DUOLINGO', 85, null),
 ('PTE', 43, null),
 ('CAMBRIDGE', 162, 'B2 First, C1 Advanced or C2 Proficiency. TOEFL Essentials 6.0 and other tests (SAT, ACT 18 Reading, AP/IB English, GRE) are also accepted; the admissions page lists SAT 470 EBRW while the 2025-26 catalog lists SAT 960, so confirm the SAT figure.')) v;
