 ('TOEFL_IBT', 79, 'Home Edition and TOEFL iTP China accepted; TOEFL Essentials minimum 8.5 also accepted. School code 3771. No 1-6 scale minimum is published.'),
 ('IELTS', 6.5, 'IELTS One Skill Retake is also considered.'),
 ('DUOLINGO', 105, null),
 ('PTE', 54, 'PTE Academic. Michigan English Test (MET) minimum 58 is also accepted.')) v;
