 ('43261305-7384-5b16-8496-e718da0e2ede', '2024-2025', 8846, 8043, 1286, 32, 30, 8695, 7903, 113, 110, 27, 9, 3.43, 99.76, '{"4.0": 23, "3.75-3.99": 12, "3.50-3.74": 19, "3.25-3.49": 15, "3.00-3.24": 12, "2.50-2.99": 13, "2.0-2.49": 4, "1.0-1.99": 2}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2024 first-years; the 2024-2025 edition is the newest on tamuk.edu/pes): 8,846 applied, 8,043 admitted (90.9%), 1,286 enrolled. International: 32 applied, 30 admitted, 5 enrolled; 6 applicants of unknown residency. No waitlist, no early decision or early action. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column (C11); average GPA 3.43 is C12. Class rank (C10, 94% reporting): top tenth 12%, top quarter 39%. SAT submitters 348 (27%), ACT 115 (9%). Undergraduate enrollment 5,386 and 72 nonresidents are B2 total undergraduates. Student-faculty ratio 18:1 is CDS I-2.', '44027f06-d0b2-517c-97d4-547529aebd23');
