 ('ba35d201-8242-5468-a746-8bf4c90ea7df'::uuid, 'Engineering (incl. Computer Science and Engineering Technology)', 'engineering', 'Program GPA requirement 2.85; applicants who meet the general 2.50 GPA but not the program requirement are admitted to Interdisciplinary Studies with a program-interest attribute. Engineering and Computer Science also list ACT 17 composite and 17 Math, or SAT 930 total and 470 Math.'),
 ('60af4c95-9b55-5056-a627-13119af18593'::uuid, 'Nursing', 'nursing', 'Program GPA requirement 3.00 (same for health-related pre-professional programs); a student who meets the general requirements but not the program''s is admitted to Interdisciplinary Studies with a program-interest attribute. Higher test score requirements apply.')) v;

