 ('46975e20-28ac-5ece-bc3c-dd728fead7c0', '2023-2024', 11492, 32336, 12084, 998, 4992, 28728, 'merit_only', true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; The Foundation Fellowship (application due Nov 1) is open to international first-years: $30,000 stipend plus a waiver of the difference between in-state and international tuition. The need-and-merit scholarships listed require Georgia residency and a FAFSA.', '2dd6219e-61b0-5e38-80cc-12816c395763');
