 ('8fb2df3f-14e5-5968-a769-9d6e0158d975', '2025-2026', 7355, 6465, 1185, 49, 39, 7215, 6347, 91, 79, 60, 4, 3.33, 100.0, '{"4.0": 13.16, "3.75-3.99": 10.13, "3.50-3.74": 14.77, "3.25-3.49": 18.31, "3.00-3.24": 17.13, "2.50-2.99": 24.47, "2.0-2.49": 1.86, "1.0-1.99": 0.17}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 residency split (fall 2025): in-state 7,215 / out-of-state 91 / international 49 applicants; admitted 6,347 / 79 / 39; enrolled 1,165 / 7 / 13. Undergraduate enrollment 12,441 and nonresident undergraduates 229 are the CDS B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' figures (fall 2025); the student-faculty ratio (18:1) is the fall 2024 College Navigator figure because the CDS ratio could not be read. No waiting list, no early decision or early action. UHD is test-optional, so SAT/ACT percentiles describe the 60% (SAT) and 4% (ACT) of enrollees who submitted scores.', '10a17964-a572-528a-98fd-eba5403c8b4b');
