 ('8fb2df3f-14e5-5968-a769-9d6e0158d975', '2025-2026', 7433, 19583, 19583, 1456, 14802, 660, 4674, false, 'CDS G1/G5 (2025-26, first-year): non-resident tuition $19,583 plus required fees $1,456. UHD has no on-campus housing; the room-and-board figure is the food and housing estimate for commuters not living at home. G5 also lists transportation $3,016. College Navigator (2024-25) showed out-of-state tuition and fees $17,548 and out-of-state off-campus total cost of attendance $36,964.; The international admissions pages list no scholarships for international students. UHD''s Competitive Scholarship Tuition Waiver can reduce non-resident and international tuition for students holding a competitive scholarship of at least $1,000 per term from a college or department scholarship committee. The CDS nonresident-aid section (H6) could not be read from the PDF text.', '10a17964-a572-528a-98fd-eba5403c8b4b');
