 ('TOEFL_IBT', 'required_option', 61, 'Internet-based minimum 61; paper-based minimum 500. Institution code 6917.'),
 ('IELTS', 'required_option', 5.5, null),
 ('DUOLINGO', 'required_option', 85, 'The page names Duolingo first and says the university requires 85 or higher.'),
 ('PTE', 'required_option', 43, null),
 ('CAMBRIDGE', 'accepted', null, 'Cambridge English Level B1 or higher; no numeric score is given. Other accepted proofs: iTEP 3.5, SAT 1100 (Reading+Math), ACT 18, MELAB 69, WASSCE/WAEC C4 in English, completion of a CEA-accredited English program.')) v;
