 ('4b498114-f00f-50c8-b50f-e87a704ecf30', '2024-2025', 10669, 9670, 1303, 761, 687, 6741, 6150, 3164, 2833, 10, 1, 3.29, 99.46, 'CDS 2024-2025 (fall 2024 entering class), C1: exact counts; the residency columns also include 3 applicants of unknown residency. International admit rate 687 of 761. Only 10% of enrollees submitted SAT and 1% ACT (C9), so the percentiles come from a small group. The GPA distribution and the C7 importance checkboxes were not machine-readable, so they are omitted. The 2025-2026 CDS was not found as a file (the university''s archive page stops at 2024-25); this is the latest readable year.', 'f01cb20c-4da2-51a8-9f3e-5348e8d68d15');
