 ('62f8aac6-4b22-5a10-a8a1-7a936d20386e', '2024-2025', 13676, 11345, 2011, 622, 546, 10271, 8503, 2783, 2296, 27, 2, 3.72, 100, '{"4.0": 32.62, "3.75-3.99": 15.76, "3.50-3.74": 15.27, "3.25-3.49": 16.46, "3.00-3.24": 14.77, "2.50-2.99": 5.02, "2.0-2.49": 0.1}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2024 entering class); this is the newest CDS on UMass Lowell''s Common Data Set page when checked, so the figures are one cycle old. Residency split (known physical address): in-state 10,271 / out-of-state 2,783 / international 622 applicants; 8,503 / 2,296 / 546 admitted; 1,778 / 193 / 40 enrolled. Undergrad enrollment is B1 ''Total undergraduate Students'' (6,897 + 5,211 + 3 + 11 = 12,122); the nonresident count (305) is the B2 ''Total Undergraduates'' column. SAT/ACT percentiles cover only the 27% (550) / 2% (46) of enrollees who submitted scores. CDS C14 (2024-25): priority date Nov. 5, closing date June 1.', 'c024cff2-baa8-538e-a4ac-d7b35524f94b');
