 ('6894f30d-eb57-54c0-9cda-fc0185e4c79b', '2024-2025', 9076, 20122, 11351, 1250, 5000, 37723, 'merit_only', false, false, true, 'College Navigator 2024-25 (tuition and fees, first-year full-time): in-state $9,076, out-of-state $20,122; books $1,250; on-campus food and housing $11,351; other expenses $5,000; total on campus out-of-state $37,723.; The manual says financial aid is not available for international students; the international page says they may be eligible for merit scholarships based on academic profile. No amounts or criteria are published, and the scholarships page lists only outside sponsors for international students.', '91ca9c6d-1583-50a8-b295-08e397dfbda1');
