 ('cc9f05d8-5e03-50e1-8d55-494b90189707', '2025-2026', 27218, 21170, 4934, 714, 549, 18398, 15202, 8106, 5419, 16, 27, 3.56, 93.74, '{"4.0": 4.4, "3.75-3.99": 23.6, "3.50-3.74": 30.6, "3.25-3.49": 26.0, "3.00-3.24": 12.5, "2.50-2.99": 2.5, "2.0-2.49": 0.4, "1.0-1.99": 0.1}'::jsonb, 'Fall 2025 first-time first-year cohort, CDS C1 residency table (in-state / out-of-state / nonresident: 18,398 / 8,106 / 714 applied; 15,202 / 5,419 / 549 admitted; 4,305 / 497 / 132 enrolled). Only 16% of enrollees submitted SAT and 27% ACT, so the score percentiles describe part of the class. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column of C11. Undergraduate enrollment is the B1 total undergraduates (13,380 men + 12,833 women); intl_undergrads is the B2 nonresident total undergraduates (700). Early action exists (C22, closes Nov 1); no early decision and no waitlist.', 'e594ad86-3b64-57e6-a6ca-11ac9a4e6bd4');
