 ('fd51551f-066b-55a6-8a40-cbe361308c63', '2025-2026', 8526, 8278, 899, 1690, 1641, 5406, 5300, 1430, 1337, 4, 14, 3.43, 97.44, '{"4.0": 19, "3.75-3.99": 11, "3.50-3.74": 14, "3.25-3.49": 15, "3.00-3.24": 15, "2.50-2.99": 23, "2.0-2.49": 3, "1.0-1.99": 0}'::jsonb, 'Fall 2025 first-time first-year cohort, CDS C1 residency table (in-state / out-of-state / international: 5,406 / 1,430 / 1,690 applied; 5,300 / 1,337 / 1,641 admitted; 755 / 104 / 40 enrolled). Only 34 enrolled students (4%) submitted SAT and 125 (14%) ACT, so the score percentiles describe a small group. No early decision or early action in the CDS (C21/C22); no waitlist.', '1cc9026b-4001-5e41-badd-d8fec27ba946');
