 ('TOEFL_IBT', 'required_option', 79, 'Exams taken before Jan. 21, 2026; MyBest not accepted.'),
 ('TOEFL_IBT_2026', 'required_option', 4, 'Exams taken on or after Jan. 21, 2026 (1-6 scale).'),
 ('IELTS', 'required_option', 6.0, 'IELTS Academic, overall band; One Skill Retake not accepted.'),
 ('DUOLINGO', 'required_option', 100, null),
 ('PTE', 'required_option', 53, null),
 ('CAMBRIDGE', 'accepted', null, 'C1 Advanced or C2 Proficiency, minimum level C1 (no numeric score printed). UNT also accepts the Michigan English Test (MET) with section scores of 54. Applicants without acceptable English proof may qualify for conditional admission with study at UNT''s Intensive English Language Institute (IELI) first; College of Music applicants are handled separately.')) v;
