 ('81d84e01-1c08-57f5-a6df-4c57b70596a7', '2025-2026', 1563, 1508, 618, 87, 82, 1408, 1359, 64, 63, 40, 5, 3.33, 38, '{"4.0": 11, "3.75-3.99": 16, "3.50-3.74": 16, "3.25-3.49": 16, "3.00-3.24": 13, "2.50-2.99": 20, "2.0-2.49": 7, "1.0-1.99": 1}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 residency split (fall 2025): 4 applicants and admits of unknown residency are not in the in-state/out-of-state/international columns. Undergrad enrollment 3,991 and nonresident undergrads 197 are the CDS B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' figures (fall 2025); the student-faculty ratio (19:1) is the fall 2024 College Navigator figure because the CDS ratio could not be read. No waiting list, no early decision or early action. Only 38% of enrollees reported a high school GPA, so the GPA figures describe a minority.', '7ff46818-a89d-501b-b8f4-e10dd36b7bff');
