 ('TOEFL_IBT', 74, 'Full admission, tests before 2026-01-21. Conditional ''Foundation'' admission: 69-73 (up to two semesters of English for Academic Purposes alongside degree courses). TOEFL Home Edition not accepted.'),
 ('TOEFL_IBT_2026', 4.0, 'Full admission, tests on/after 2026-01-21 (page does not name the 1-6 scale). Foundation admission: 3.5.'),
 ('IELTS', 6.0, 'Foundation admission: 5.5.'),
 ('DUOLINGO', 105, 'Foundation admission: 95-100. Score report can be uploaded to the application portal.'),
 ('PTE', 46, 'Listed as PTEA. Foundation admission: 36-45.')) v;
