 ('0bdbab7a-c9ef-5b09-a7cb-c393402bc138', '2025-2026', 72933, 30446, 7129, 13054, 4653, 15260, 6980, 44619, 18813, 15363, 8350, 2252, 19.12, 4.89, 3.84, 99.87, '{"4.0": 18.12, "3.75-3.99": 58.07, "3.50-3.74": 18.08, "3.25-3.49": 4.42, "3.00-3.24": 1.0, "2.50-2.99": 0.24, "2.0-2.49": 0.07, "1.0-1.99": 0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1/C2/C9/C11/C12, fall 2025 entering class. No early decision or early action. CDS C8 marks SAT/ACT as not used in admission decisions (test-blind); scores shown are from the minority who submitted them.', 'ab6f2612-f655-5d07-8b4b-252067fb8cd1');
