 ('0da9a1c7-178e-5fad-a201-bf2a0a9cf302', '2023-2024', 2310, 2163, 260, 21, 'Baseline from IPEDS (fall 2023 entering class, ADM2023). UW-Superior''s Common Data Set is linked from its institutional research page but sits behind a Microsoft sign-in and could not be read, so CDS figures (international applicants/admits, GPA) are not added. IPEDS reports ACT only (no SAT). College Navigator for fall 2024 shows 1,517 applicants, 93% admitted, 19% of admits enrolled.', '34bf3a14-8d20-5b7c-834a-bdd0d9be362b', 'admissions_site');
