 ('f883d264-3603-549b-b89e-3e5910ec3fa4', '2023-2024', 70144, 22296, 800, 1250, 90250, 'need_aware_full_need', true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Wellesley is need-blind only for U.S. citizens and permanent residents. For international citizens admission is need-aware and the College can fund only a limited number of awards, but admitted students receive their full calculated need. International applicants must request aid when applying (not accepted after the admission decision). Read via search-extracted page text (site blocks automated fetch); verify.', '57b74a09-e151-57ca-8ba4-20bf04ddf7bb');
