 ('579eb60f-c4e2-5846-86cd-0a14de0f5f9b', '2024-2025', 20150, 15570, 4126, 1013, 369, 3485, 2572, 15652, 12629, 55.64, 23.39, 3.7, '{"4.0": 34.51, "3.75-3.99": 16.32, "3.50-3.74": 17.03, "3.25-3.49": 8.86, "3.00-3.24": 12.04, "2.50-2.99": 9.03, "2.0-2.49": 2.01, "1.0-1.99": 0.0}'::jsonb, 'CDS C1 (fall 2024) - the 2025-26 CDS is not posted yet. International applicants: 369 of 1,013 admitted (36%). Undergrad enrollment 18,206 is B1/B2 total undergraduates; intl_undergrads 314 is the B2 nonresident total. SAT composite 25/50/75 = 1010/1110/1210. GPA distribution is the ''all enrolled students'' column (0.19% had GPA below 1.0). CDS C7 importance ratings and the C8A test-policy checkboxes could not be read from the PDF text, so factors are left out; the admissions site says tests are optional. No early decision/action reported here.', '426b771a-aeaa-5a00-9717-d101c5190f4e');
