 ('579eb60f-c4e2-5846-86cd-0a14de0f5f9b', '2024-2025', 8688, 27192, 27192, 1416, 14582, 950, 2050, false, true, 'CDS G1/G5 (first-year, 2024-25). Nonresident tuition per credit hour $1,133, resident $362. Transportation estimate $1,290 not included in other_usd. CDS H6: 200 nonresident undergraduates received institutional aid, average $21,636; the PDF text does not show which aid-type boxes are checked.; International students are automatically considered for the Climb Higher Scholarship on admission (non-resident Morgantown amounts for students admitted for 2026-27: Level 1 GPA 3.8+ and SAT 1360/ACT 30 = $17,000/yr; Level 2 GPA 3.8+ = $14,000; Level 3 GPA 3.5-3.79 = $11,000; Level 4 GPA 3.0-3.49 = $8,000; renewable up to 8 semesters). The 2027-28 page lists non-resident amounts as TBD. University Merit scholarship needs a separate application. English Language Pathways Program and Intensive English Program offer conditional admission for Morgantown applicants. The PDF does not show whether need-based institutional aid is open to nonresidents.', '426b771a-aeaa-5a00-9717-d101c5190f4e');
