 ('3a4758e1-f1ed-51fc-9bb9-6d18d1454424', '2023-2024', 72510, 18240, 1000, 2700, 89520, 'need_aware_full_need', true, true, false, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Not need-blind for international applicants, but aid meets 100% of demonstrated need, is guaranteed for all four years, and about 70% of international students receive aid (average award over $90,000). Applicants who may seek aid at any point must answer Yes to the aid question on the application; aid materials are requested only after admission. No merit scholarships are described.', 'd53ff983-ad8c-502d-b043-74351f02b864');
