 ('7c85ddd8-639a-5e71-b21a-2b1f88888ed4', '2023-2024', 6159, 4220, 1162, 2, 44, 'Baseline from IPEDS (fall 2023 entering class, ADM2023): 6,159 applied, 4,220 admitted, 1,162 enrolled. Winona State''s newest posted Common Data Set is 2022-2023 (numbers not machine-readable), so no CDS is used; GPA distribution, residency and international applicant/admit counts are not available. College Navigator shows 6,642 applicants and 75% admitted for Fall 2024 (exact admits not given, so none are stored). Undergraduate enrollment (5,317) is the College Navigator Fall 2024 figure; international undergraduate count left null.', '98ba4b76-586f-57d9-a8d9-a6e1a328a1cd', 'admissions_site');
