 ('8b254d23-dd7a-5c62-b72c-40cf53e4a173', '2025-2026', 5156, 4537, 756, 113, 98, 4526, 3990, 517, 449, 17.87, 0.38, 3.41, 100, '{"4.0": 20.5, "3.75-3.99": 12.5, "3.50-3.74": 15.0, "3.25-3.49": 11.8, "3.00-3.24": 13.3, "2.50-2.99": 18.1, "2.0-2.49": 8.5, "1.0-1.99": 0.3}'::jsonb, 'CDS section C of the posted 2025-26 workbook (C1 residency split: in-state 4,526 / out-of-state 517 / international 113 applicants; 98 international admits). Its counts match the fall 2024 entering class (College Navigator also shows 5,156 applicants), so they are not fall 2025 counts. 141 students (17.87%) submitted SAT and only 3 submitted ACT, so ACT percentiles are not recorded. Test-optional; SAT/ACT not required (C8).', '669510d0-814c-57c9-81b6-ef374c5eab01');
