 ('2868846e-bf86-500b-b3bf-d609698886b1', '0484af38-0265-5b9f-aea4-0095a7ef5c5e', '2026-27', 'application', 'ED2', 'Early Decision II', '2027-01-05', 'Binding. Notification by mid February (no exact date).', 'a75703ea-0f68-55cb-ba38-6c1feea65d6e'),
