 ('c924079a-913d-5949-af67-21c8074dff6f', '2025-2026', 10457, 10057, 1698, 3313, 3160, 6399, 6187, 745, 710, 4, 52, 3.51, 99, '{"4.0": 22.6, "3.75-3.99": 17.8, "3.50-3.74": 16.1, "3.25-3.49": 13.0, "3.00-3.24": 10.1, "2.50-2.99": 13.2, "2.0-2.49": 6.8, "1.0-1.99": 0.4}'::jsonb, 'Counts are CDS C1 (fall 2025), Dayton campus only. International admit rate is 95.4% (3,160 of 3,313), close to the overall 96.2%. No waiting list, early decision or early action. Only 71 enrollees submitted SAT (4%) vs 879 ACT (52%), so SAT percentiles describe a very small group. GPA distribution is the C11 ''all enrolled'' column. Undergrad and international counts are B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' (nonresident 480).', 'bfd37e18-ccb1-5d06-9ecd-33ffde0e5870');
