 ('63892b3f-7d76-58af-a7b1-6c8cd6ef393d', '2025-2026', 9090, 8313, 1891, 3333, 3218, 4478, 3965, 1280, 1130, 9, 39, 3.07, 20.8, '{"4.0": 21.6, "3.75-3.99": 12.7, "3.50-3.74": 15.2, "3.25-3.49": 12.7, "3.00-3.24": 9.5, "2.50-2.99": 11.4, "2.0-2.49": 7.2, "1.0-1.99": 6.6}'::jsonb, 'Counts are CDS C1 (fall 2025). International admit rate is 96.5% (3,218 of 3,333); 268 international first-years enrolled. No waiting list, early decision or early action. Only 20.8% of first-years had a high school GPA on file (C12), so the 3.07 average covers that group; the C11 ''all enrolled'' column also shows 3.1% below 1.0 (omitted here). Undergrad and international counts are B1 ''Total Undergraduates'' (nonresident 977).', '30e8eb38-7944-5649-89f9-593eeccd82a8');
